<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<meta name="description" content="App Genap Zone service dashboard and network status.">
	<title>App Genap Zone / Service Dashboard</title>
	<style>
		:root {
			--night: #101923;
			--surface: #182633;
			--surface-light: #203543;
			--text: #eef5f1;
			--muted: #9db1af;
			--teal: #5ed0bb;
			--yellow: #f1c66b;
			--line: rgba(215, 239, 232, 0.14);
		}

		* { box-sizing: border-box; }

		body {
			margin: 0;
			min-height: 100vh;
			color: var(--text);
			background: var(--night);
			font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;
		}

		.shell {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 230px 1fr;
			width: min(1260px, 100%);
			min-height: 100vh;
			margin: 0 auto;
		}

		aside {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			padding: 32px 24px;
			border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
			background: #0c141d;
		}

		.logo {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 11px;
			color: var(--teal);
			font-size: 0.8rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			letter-spacing: 0.13em;
			text-transform: uppercase;
		}

		.logo-mark {
			display: grid;
			place-items: center;
			width: 34px;
			height: 34px;
			border: 1px solid var(--teal);
			border-radius: 8px;
			font-size: 1.05rem;
		}

		.nav-label {
			margin: 76px 0 17px;
			color: #607876;
			font-size: 0.68rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			letter-spacing: 0.16em;
			text-transform: uppercase;
		}

		nav a {
			display: block;
			padding: 11px 12px;
			border-left: 2px solid var(--teal);
			color: var(--text);
			background: rgba(94, 208, 187, 0.1);
			font-size: 0.86rem;
			text-decoration: none;
		}

		.side-note {
			margin-top: auto;
			color: var(--muted);
			font-size: 0.75rem;
			line-height: 1.6;
		}

		.side-note strong { display: block; color: var(--yellow); margin-bottom: 4px; }

		main { padding: 42px clamp(24px, 5vw, 72px); }

		.heading {
			display: flex;
			align-items: flex-start;
			justify-content: space-between;
			gap: 24px;
			margin-bottom: 58px;
		}

		.kicker {
			margin: 0 0 13px;
			color: var(--teal);
			font-size: 0.72rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			letter-spacing: 0.16em;
			text-transform: uppercase;
		}

		h1 {
			margin: 0;
			font-family: Georgia, serif;
			font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.4rem);
			font-weight: 400;
			letter-spacing: -0.055em;
			line-height: 0.92;
		}

		.live {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 9px;
			padding: 10px 14px;
			border: 1px solid rgba(94, 208, 187, 0.35);
			border-radius: 999px;
			color: var(--teal);
			font-size: 0.72rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			letter-spacing: 0.08em;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			white-space: nowrap;
		}

		.live span { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); }

		.summary {
			max-width: 590px;
			margin: 0 0 38px;
			color: var(--muted);
			font-size: 1.05rem;
			line-height: 1.7;
		}

		.metrics {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 12px;
			margin-bottom: 34px;
		}

		.metric, .route {
			border: 1px solid var(--line);
			border-radius: 12px;
			background: var(--surface);
		}

		.metric { padding: 22px; }

		.metric small {
			display: block;
			margin-bottom: 26px;
			color: var(--muted);
			font-size: 0.68rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			letter-spacing: 0.12em;
			text-transform: uppercase;
		}

		.metric strong {
			display: block;
			color: var(--yellow);
			font-family: Georgia, serif;
			font-size: 1.5rem;
			font-weight: 400;
		}

		.route { padding: 26px; }

		.route h2 {
			margin: 0 0 22px;
			color: var(--text);
			font-family: Georgia, serif;
			font-size: 1.55rem;
			font-weight: 400;
		}

		.route-line {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 13px;
			padding: 15px 0;
			border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
			color: var(--muted);
			font-size: 0.83rem;
		}

		.route-line b { margin-left: auto; color: var(--teal); font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-weight: 400; }
		.arrow { color: var(--yellow); font-size: 1.2rem; }

		footer {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: space-between;
			gap: 20px;
			margin-top: 38px;
			color: #607876;
			font-size: 0.72rem;
		}

		@media (max-width: 760px) {
			.shell { display: block; }
			aside { min-height: auto; padding: 20px 24px; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
			.nav-label, nav, .side-note { display: none; }
			main { padding: 36px 20px; }
			.heading { display: block; margin-bottom: 40px; }
			.live { display: inline-flex; margin-top: 24px; }
			.metrics { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
			footer { flex-direction: column; }
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="shell">
		<aside>
			<div class="logo"><span class="logo-mark">G</span> Anycast Lab</div>
			<p class="nav-label">Current zone</p>
			<nav><a href="#overview">App Genap</a></nav>
			<div class="side-note"><strong>Environment</strong>Production / Genap<br>Traffic is monitored and ready.</div>
		</aside>

		<main id="overview">
			<header class="heading">
				<div>
					<p class="kicker">Application service dashboard</p>
					<h1>App Genap</h1>
				</div>
				<div class="live"><span></span> Operational</div>
			</header>

			<p class="summary">The Genap application zone provides a dependable destination for workloads on the even-side network, with traffic delivered through the shared anycast service.</p>

			<section class="metrics" aria-label="Genap service metrics">
				<article class="metric"><small>Server Identity</small><strong>{{ ansible_host }}</strong></article>
				<article class="metric"><small>Client network</small><strong>10.12.100.0/24</strong></article>
				<article class="metric"><small>Protocol</small><strong>HTTP / HTTPS</strong></article>
			</section>

			<section class="route" aria-label="Traffic route">
				<h2>Traffic route</h2>
				<div class="route-line"><span class="arrow">01</span> Shared anycast entry <b>10.15.100.10</b></div>
				<div class="route-line"><span class="arrow">02</span> Genap client segment <b>10.12.100.0/24</b></div>
				<div class="route-line"><span class="arrow">03</span> Application service <b>10.12.30.10:80</b></div>
			</section>

			<footer><span>App Genap Zone</span><span>Service status · operational</span></footer>
		</main>
	</div>
</body>
</html>
